  passengerName: Maxim Yatsenko
  portrait: {fileID: -6470460504253458178, guid: 30bec57c9acc09e4e8d91d992e7e8b82, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 3
  charDescription: "Maxim Yatsenko is a 35 years old man, with unclear origines.
    Gambler at heart, he's a risk taker and has trouble to stop in the middle of
    a streak, winning or loosing. However, he likes to talk (a bit too much maybe
    ?) and has a past of a con man who made a lot of friends, and as many if not
    more enemies. He's fleeing the country because \u201Cthe game is dead here, money
    move somewere else\u201D but as he hide when an officer comes around [\u201Che's
    not a one-eyed lad with a broken nose, is he ?\u201D], it seems there are other
    reasons for his departure. Beside his gambling addiction, he has a nose for opportunities
    and can find nice deals at stations."
  bonus:
  - bagou
  - risque tout
  - observateur
